{
    "title": "Toca Boca Jr",
    "description": "The best games for kids ages 2-8, trusted by over 100 million families\r\n\r\nToca Boca Jr brings <b>Toca Boca\u2019s most-loved games for kids</b> together in one app! \r\n\r\n<b>Ages 2-8</b> \ud83d\udc66 \ud83d\udc67 Perfect for preschoolers, Toca Boca Jr is full of fun ways for kids to play, create, build worlds, and explore.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf31 <b>Toca Boca Nature</b>\r\nCreate your own world, shape nature and watch the animal games begin!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f <b>Toca Boca Cars</b>\r\nStart your engines! Kids get behind the wheel in Toca Boca Jr\u2019s newest car game, driving vehicles and building their own streets.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf73 <b>Toca Boca Kitchen 2</b>\r\nCooking games that don\u2019t make a mess! Create, cook, and serve all sorts of tasty (and not-so-tasty) food in Toca Boca Kitchen 2 to some hungry characters and see what they like. Cooking games for kids are perfect for unleashing creativity!\r\n\r\n\ud83e\uddea <b>Toca Boca Lab: Elements</b>\r\nExplore the fun and electrifying world of science and discover all 118 of the elements from the periodic table! Unlock a passion for early STEM learning!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc77 <b>Toca Boca Builders</b>\r\nJoin your six new builder buddies and create a whole new world with blocks. Unleash your creativity in this building game!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc36 <b>Toca Boca Pet Doctor</b>\r\nKids take care of 15 pets of all shapes and sizes! From a turtle flipped over on its shell to a dinosaur with a stomach bug, there are lots of animals to rescue. Toca Pet Doctor has the perfect animal games for kids!\r\n\r\n<b>Subscription Benefits</b>\r\nToca Boca Jr is part of Piknik \u2013 the best kids apps in one subscription! Get full access to a bundle of the worlds best games for kids from award-winning studios Toca Boca (creators of Toca Boca World), Sago Mini, and Originator for one low monthly price.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udedc Play downloaded games offline <b>without WiFi</b> or internet\r\n\ud83c\udd93 Try before you buy! Download the Toca Boca Jr app to start your <b>free trial</b>\r\n\u2705 <b>COPPA</b> and <b>kidSAFE certified</b> \u2013 safe and secure screen time for kids\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 Use one subscription across <b>multiple devices</b> for easy access to award-winning games for kids\r\n\ud83d\ude45\ud83c\udffc <b>No third-party advertising</b> or in-app purchases\r\n\ud83d\udc4d Cancel Toca Boca Jr anytime with <b>no hassle</b>\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy\r\n\r\nAll of Toca Boca\u2019s products are COPPA-compliant. We take privacy very seriously, and we\u2019re committed to providing safe and secure apps for kids that parents can trust. To learn more about how Tocaboca designs and maintains safe games for kids, please read our:\r\n\r\nPrivacy policy: https://playpiknik.link/privacy-policy\r\nTerms of use: https://playpiknik.link/terms-of-use\r\n\r\nAbout Toca Boca\r\n\r\nToca Boca is the award-winning game studio behind Toca Life World and Toca Hair Salon 4. We design digital toys for kids that stimulate the imagination \u2013 all in a safe way without third-party advertising, trusted by millions of parents around the world.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The best games for kids ages 2-8, trusted by over 100 million families<br><br>Toca Boca Jr brings <b>Toca Boca\u2019s most-loved games for kids</b> together in one app! <br><br><b>Ages 2-8</b> \ud83d\udc66 \ud83d\udc67 Perfect for preschoolers, Toca Boca Jr is full of fun ways for kids to play, create, build worlds, and explore.<br><br>\ud83c\udf31 <b>Toca Boca Nature</b><br>Create your own world, shape nature and watch the animal games begin!<br><br>\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f <b>Toca Boca Cars</b><br>Start your engines! Kids get behind the wheel in Toca Boca Jr\u2019s newest car game, driving vehicles and building their own streets.<br><br>\ud83c\udf73 <b>Toca Boca Kitchen 2</b><br>Cooking games that don\u2019t make a mess! Create, cook, and serve all sorts of tasty (and not-so-tasty) food in Toca Boca Kitchen 2 to some hungry characters and see what they like. Cooking games for kids are perfect for unleashing creativity!<br><br>\ud83e\uddea <b>Toca Boca Lab: Elements</b><br>Explore the fun and electrifying world of science and discover all 118 of the elements from the periodic table! Unlock a passion for early STEM learning!<br><br>\ud83d\udc77 <b>Toca Boca Builders</b><br>Join your six new builder buddies and create a whole new world with blocks. Unleash your creativity in this building game!<br><br>\ud83d\udc36 <b>Toca Boca Pet Doctor</b><br>Kids take care of 15 pets of all shapes and sizes! From a turtle flipped over on its shell to a dinosaur with a stomach bug, there are lots of animals to rescue. Toca Pet Doctor has the perfect animal games for kids!<br><br><b>Subscription Benefits</b><br>Toca Boca Jr is part of Piknik \u2013 the best kids apps in one subscription! Get full access to a bundle of the worlds best games for kids from award-winning studios Toca Boca (creators of Toca Boca World), Sago Mini, and Originator for one low monthly price.<br><br>\ud83d\udedc Play downloaded games offline <b>without WiFi</b> or internet<br>\ud83c\udd93 Try before you buy! Download the Toca Boca Jr app to start your <b>free trial</b><br>\u2705 <b>COPPA</b> and <b>kidSAFE certified</b> \u2013 safe and secure screen time for kids<br>\ud83d\udcf1 Use one subscription across <b>multiple devices</b> for easy access to award-winning games for kids<br>\ud83d\ude45\ud83c\udffc <b>No third-party advertising</b> or in-app purchases<br>\ud83d\udc4d Cancel Toca Boca Jr anytime with <b>no hassle</b><br><br>Privacy Policy<br><br>All of Toca Boca\u2019s products are COPPA-compliant. We take privacy very seriously, and we\u2019re committed to providing safe and secure apps for kids that parents can trust. To learn more about how Tocaboca designs and maintains safe games for kids, please read our:<br><br>Privacy policy: https://playpiknik.link/privacy-policy<br>Terms of use: https://playpiknik.link/terms-of-use<br><br>About Toca Boca<br><br>Toca Boca is the award-winning game studio behind Toca Life World and Toca Hair Salon 4. We design digital toys for kids that stimulate the imagination \u2013 all in a safe way without third-party advertising, trusted by millions of parents around the world.",
